ade journey we call the Expansion Model.\n\nWhop for memberships. Klaviyo for email after onboarding. a custom admin panel so he controls everything himself.\n\nand we built it to handle 100,000+ users from day one. because if it blows up, you don't want to rebuild it.\u20283 weeks later.\n\nAnthony now runs it completely on his own.\n\nhis words: \"I never had to ask for the same correction twice\"\n\nhttp://kargul.studio/work/am-trades", "raw_text": {"text": "we took a trading education platform from idea to 12,000+ registered users in 8 weeks.\n\nAnthony (@_amtrades) came to us with one problem: his platform needed to convert free users to paid ones.\n\nso we built the whole thing from scratch.\n\nonboarding. a free dashboard with study tools. premium sections, locked states, and an upgrade journey we call the Expansion Model.\n\nWhop for memberships. Klaviyo for email after onboarding. a custom admin panel so he controls everything himself.\n\nand we built it to handle 100,000+ users from day one. because if it blows up, you don't want to rebuild it.\u20283 weeks later.\n\nAnthony now runs it completely on his own.\n\nhis words: \"I never had to ask for the same correction twice\"\n\nhttps://t.co/XDTXNGyNml", "display_text_range": [0, 741], "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [97, 107], "original": "_amtrades", "id": "777642962973057024"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [278, 301], "id": "2110339316190789632", "display": "pic.x.com/hhWL02HLT9", "original": "https://t.co/hhWL02HLT9", "replacement": "https://x.com/marcelkargul/status/2110339520382005740/video/1"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [718, 741], "original": "https://t.co/XDTXNGyNml", "replacement": "http://kargul.studio/work/am-trades", "display": "kargul.studio/work/am-trades"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "marcelkargul", "url": "https://x.com/marcelkargul", "id": "1566851334283870210", "followers": 60769, "following": 1197, "likes": 33949, "media_count": 3615, "statuses": 27824, "name": "Marcel", "des